# Pako settings. Local mode needs NONE of these: `npm install && npm start`.
# To add something, copy this file to ~/.pako/.env (or ./.env), fill in only the block you want, and restart.
# Every setting is explained in docs/channels.md ("Add things when you want them") and docs/configuration.md.

# --- Email inbox for Pako (AgentMail, free) -------------------------------------------------------
# AGENTMAIL_API_KEY=
# AGENTMAIL_INBOX=my-assistant@agentmail.to
# AGENTMAIL_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...
# AGENTMAIL_WORK_DOMAINS=mycompany.com

# --- Sending from your own domain (Resend, optional; send only) -----------------------------------
# When set, the emails you ask Pako to send go out through Resend instead of the AgentMail inbox.
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_...
# RESEND_FROM=Pako <hello@example.com>
# RESEND_REPLY_TO=

# --- Calendar (Zoho, read only) -------------------------------------------------------------------
# ZOHO_CLIENT_ID=
# ZOHO_CLIENT_SECRET=
# ZOHO_GRANT_CODE=

# --- Slack (read only) ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SLACK_USER_TOKEN=xoxp-...
# On a computer, connect Slack from the panel instead (docs/channels.md, "Slack and Zoom from the panel"). Optional: the App-Level Token (xapp-...) for live messages by Socket Mode.
# SLACK_APP_TOKEN=
# On a server with a public address, instead or as well: the Signing Secret for the events address.
# SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET=

# --- Book a table -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=

# --- Telegram next to your chat (a bot from @BotFather), see "Telegram next to your chat" ---------
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
# TELEGRAM_OWNER_ID=

# --- WhatsApp instead of the panel chat: the hosted way, see "Run it on a server" -------------------
# WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=
# WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET=
# WHATSAPP_VERIFY_TOKEN=
# ASSISTANT_BRIDGE_TOKEN=
# PERSONAL_CALLER_TOKEN=
# PERSONAL_OWNER_NAME=
# PERSONAL_OWNER_NUMBER=+447700900456
# The notice template that lets Pako write first after WhatsApp's 24 hours: a Utility template approved by Meta.
# Create it as pako_notice in English; name another (and its language) here if yours differs.
# WHATSAPP_REMINDER_TEMPLATE=pako_notice
# WHATSAPP_TEMPLATE_LANG=en
